ONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 설 문 명 : 학부교육선도대학 육성사업(ACE) 만족도 조사</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 조사 대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">본교 재학생</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 조사 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>2015. 11. 25.(수) ~ 12. 23.(수)</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 조사 방법 : 웹 기반 설문조사(※ 익명 조사)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [학부교육선도대학 육성사업(ACE) 설문조사 링크 주소]</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;함초롬바탕&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: blue; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt\"><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etc/ace_survey_student.html\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etc/ace_survey_student.html</span></strong></span></span></font></u></a></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" 